e for that fake shit\n[01:57.66]Lawn mower through the grass, so I can see the snakes, yeah\n[02:00.82]I always been good at that, 40 in the Fendi bag\n[02:03.88]You know I can't go for that\n[02:05.96]Day ones changed sides, they some hoes for that\n[02:08.82]Flex up on they ass, I got dough for that now\n[02:12.60]And break bread with the ones that held me down (Yeah)\n[02:16.42]I love it when the vibe's right\n[02:20.26]I been gettin' too high\n[02:23.20]Coolin' with the same gang\n[02:26.14]We don't believe in new guys\n[02:29.42]Yeah, yeah, the vibe's right\n[02:32.64]I been gettin' too high\n[02:35.58]Coolin' with the same gang\n[02:38.52]We don't believe in new guys\n[Chorus]\n[02:39.96]Why you callin' my phone on that lame shit? Tryna hang shit\n[02:44.14]You was hatin' on us now you sayin' you was gang shit\n[02:47.22]Who you think you playin'? You must be brazy\n[02:50.34]You could go that way, with all the fakin'\n[02:53.40]Lean sippin' got my heart rate slow-pacin'\n[02:56.44]Crack rock got yo' aunty freebasin'\n[02:59.84].40 put you on the concrete, cremation\n[03:02.66]Drugs turn me to a zombie, Z Nation","words":[[11.22,11.34,"Why"],[11.4,11.44,"you"],[11.56,11.9,"callin'"],[11.98,12.16,"my"],[12.32,12.74,"phone"],[12.8,12.88,"on"],[12.92,13.02,"that"],[13.14,13.44,"lame"],[13.5,14.28,"shit?"],[14.42,14.56,"Tryna"],[14.72,14.96,"hang"],[15.06,15.2,"shit"],[15.48,15.56,"You"],[15.64,15.8,"was"],[15.86,16.26,"hatin'"],[16.3,16.42,"on"],[16.48,16.56,"us"],[16.64,16.76,"now"],[16.82,16.88,"you"],[17.0,17.36,"sayin'"],[17.42,17.48,"you"],[17.56,17.68,"was"],[17.8,18.08,"gang"],[18.16,18.3,"shit"],[18.56,18.64,"Who"],[18.78,18.86,"you"],[18.94,19.08,"think"],[19.14,19.2,"you"],[19.28,19.84,"playin'?"],[20.34,20.4,"You"],[20.5,20.66,"must"],[20.7,20.76,"be"],[20.88,21.32,"brazy"],[21.7,21.78,"You"],[21.84,22.0,"could"],[22.06,22.14,"go"],[22.42,22.7,"that"],[22.8,23.02,"way,"],[23.4,23.6,"with"],[23.66,23.72,"all"],[23.78,23.82,"the"],[23.96,24.4,"fakin'"],[